---`GET /zones/{zone_id}/logs/received/fields`
---@param input cloudflare.logs.GetReceivedFieldRequest
---@return cloudflare.logs.GetReceivedFieldResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_received_field(input) end

---Returns all dataset types that this account or zone can create. Each entry includes the dataset schema and timestamp field. The schema shows all possible fields for a dataset. However, not all fields may be available for your account or zone. When creating or updating a dataset, only fields available to your account or zone can be enabled. If you request a field that is not available, you will receive an error.
---
---`GET /accounts/{account_id}/logs/explorer/datasets/available`
---@param input cloudflare.logs.ListLogExplorerDatasetAvailablesForAccountRequest
---@return cloudflare.logs.ListLogExplorerDatasetAvailablesResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:list_log_explorer_dataset_availables_for_account(input) end

